# Debconf templates for an EARLY custom profile-selection integration.
# These are NOT automatically loaded by vanilla simple-cdd 0.6.9.
Template: my-cdd/profile-summary
Type: note
Description: Review selected custom installation profiles
 The following seven options will be applied in the documented order:
 ${MYCDD_SUMMARY}
 .
 This summary does not replace disk, ZRAM conversion, package or other approvals.

Template: my-cdd/profile-confirm
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Proceed with these selected installation profiles?
 Choose No to stop before custom profile actions. Use the installer Back
 navigation to revise selections when available.
